1
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:53,520
Mr. Chu

2
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:55,900
is indeed the top scholar in the capital.

3
00:00:56,120 --> 00:00:58,000
He not only restored the original work

4
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,600
but also added his own charm.

5
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,800
Can you see anything unusual

6
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:08,160
about this painting
of the princess's marriage alliance?

7
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:08,840
It seems

8
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,800
to use the same canvas

9
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,260
as the painting your mother left behind.

10
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:16,060
When I repainted
the Nirvana of the Phoenix,

11
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:16,940
I couldn't find

12
00:01:17,039 --> 00:01:18,300
the exact same canvas,

13
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:20,300
so I had to use rice paper instead.

14
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,260
This kind of canvas is not common,

15
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,640
and the material is very special.

16
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,570
So I remember it.

17
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:28,090
What else besides that?

18
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,650
I can't tell anything else.

19
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,490
I was so foolish.

20
00:01:37,039 --> 00:01:38,000
Even I can tell

21
00:01:39,039 --> 00:01:40,120
that the evidence of treason

22
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,520
was forged by Xue Shiyan.

23
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,940
How could he not see it?

24
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,810
He did it on purpose.

25
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,560
It is just a painting.

26
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,640
If you are interested, General,

27
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:51,240
let us admire it together.

28
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:55,520
Why is

29
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:56,759
this empty?

30
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:57,680
You old scoundrel,

31
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,640
you ordered me to forge
the Iron Cavalry Map,

32
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,480
attempting to use me

33
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:02,120
to pass military secrets in public.

34
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,780
I painted it with a special ink

35
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,720
that fades in three days.

36
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,680
Don't even think about making me

37
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,410
take the fall for your treason.

38
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,800
Everyone, bear witness.

39
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:14,120
He clearly swapped my painting.

40
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,360
You think you can frame me

41
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,480
with a blank canvas?

42
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:19,880
You think I don't know

43
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:21,340
the secret of this canvas?

44
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,720
My ink will fade,

45
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,440
but yours will not.

46
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:31,280
I ask you all to be the judge.

47
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:33,440
Xue Shiyan gave this painting to me.

48
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,740
Whatever message it holds

49
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:38,079
will be revealed by fire.

50
00:02:59,200 --> 00:02:59,920
Cui Hu!

51
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:04,370
General!

52
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:05,640
Ning Yuanci,

53
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,420
what are you doing?

54
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:08,800
The Northern spies

55
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:11,640
are hiding among the guests today.

56
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,280
Arrest them all!

57
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,320
Xue Shiyan,

58
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,760
the evidence of your treason
is conclusive.

59
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:17,960
Take him away too!

60
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,000
Ning Yuanci,

61
00:03:20,079 --> 00:03:21,720
you are too impatient.

62
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,960
The truth has not yet been fully revealed.

63
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,290
Everyone, please look.

64
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:27,640
This is

65
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,340
Ning Yuanci's personal seal.

66
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:31,600
How could this be?

67
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,130
Ning Yuanci!

68
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,050
We were all deceived by him.

69
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:58,200
Chu Qingyun is highly skilled in painting.

70
00:03:58,200 --> 00:03:59,880
Ning Yuanci wanted to use him

71
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,050
to pass on the intel.

72
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:02,920
And the private seal
in the bottom right corner

73
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:03,520
proves that

74
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:05,560
Ning Yuanci,
who holds the city defense map,

75
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,800
is the real traitor

76
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,320
and deserves to die.

77
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,170
Ning Yuanci, watch out!

78
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:34,440
You rebellious daughter,

79
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,800
you don't even recognize your own father!

80
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,530
Come with me.

81
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,520
I'm not leaving.

82
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,159
Let me go!

83
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,760
Then don't blame me for being ruthless.

84
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:40,320
Men,

85
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:41,440
tie her up!

86
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:43,720
Keying,

87
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:51,600
Chu Qingjun,

88
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:53,930
Chu Qingjun,

89
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,360
Keying,

90
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:59,600
I was too smart for my own good.

91
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,200
I thought

92
00:05:00,200 --> 00:05:01,330
I could protect you.

93
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,960
Don't speak.

94
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,800
Ning Yuanci,

95
00:05:05,960 --> 00:05:07,120
help!

96
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,040
Ning Yuanci,

97
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,080
help!

98
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,220
Keying, watch out!

99
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:32,800
Surrender now,

100
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:34,159
or she dies.

101
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:34,720
No,

102
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:35,440
don't do anything stupid.

103
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,080
Let her go.

104
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:36,650
Ying'er!

105
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:38,520
Kill Ning Yuanci,

106
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,930
and I'll let your sister go.

107
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:41,860
Leave me alone!

108
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,650
Ning Yuanci,

109
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:43,680
take her away!

110
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:45,320
Are you protecting Ning Yuanci

111
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,280
or your sister?

112
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,400
Make a choice.

113
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:48,730
General,

114
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:50,010
I will cover you.

115
00:05:50,159 --> 00:05:50,690
Retreat!

116
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:53,000
Are you coming with us or not?

117
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:56,640
Leave, now!

118
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,090
General!

119
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,530
Alright.

120
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,560
Cui Hu, hear my command.

121
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,520
Lead the army

122
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:06,170
to reclaim the Northern Frontier.

123
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:07,440
Keying,

124
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:10,040
I will make this choice for you.

125
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:11,690
Take me instead.

126
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:13,450
Let them both go.

127
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:14,120
No.

128
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:14,690
Alright.

129
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,920
A life for a life.

130
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,120
No!

131
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,640
Ning Yuanci,

132
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:32,880
do not go.

133
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,040
General!

134
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:38,720
Go!

135
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,159
You are as foolish

136
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,680
as your father.

137
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,159
No!

138
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:46,760
No!

139
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,800
Ning Yuanci, go.

140
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:56,720
Go!

141
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:57,720
Ning Yuanci!

142
00:06:59,240 --> 00:06:59,760
Go!

143
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,330
Ning Yuanci,

144
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,000
I...

145
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:11,040
As long as I die,

146
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:14,480
you can survive.

147
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,800
As long as you survive,

148
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,520
you can go back to

149
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:23,880
your own world.

150
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,160
I'm not going back.

151
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:34,000
I'm not going back.

152
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:40,159
I'm not going back, okay?

153
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:42,680
I

154
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:44,800
can't

155
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:47,120
walk

156
00:07:48,159 --> 00:07:49,360
with you

157
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:54,320
to the end of the story.

158
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:57,040
My ending

159
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,400
just

160
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:03,600
ends right

161
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:06,000
here.

162
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:13,720
No.

163
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,520
No.

164
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,400
Ning Yuanci!

165
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:27,360
Ning Yuanci!

166
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:42,520
Xuyu,

167
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:45,160
come out!

168
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:49,280
I don't want an ending like this.

169
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,320
Xue Keying,

170
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:52,970
are you sure you want to start over?

171
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:56,480
Ning Yuanci is obviously
the second male lead.

172
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,360
How could he

173
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:58,760
die so easily?

174
00:08:59,000 --> 00:08:59,920
Who's talking?

175
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,640
You said it yourself.

176
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,880
I have five chances to role-play.

177
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:07,120
Restarting with Ning Yuanci last time

178
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:09,400
and changing the method
was completely wrong.

179
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:10,860
I want to restart the plot.

180
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:12,720
I want to do it again.

181
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,760
Your plot mission

182
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:14,680
hasn't failed.

183
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,700
Xue Ruowan is still alive.

184
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,120
You can still continue acting.

185
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:21,200
If you want the plot to restart now,

186
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:23,100
the female lead Xue Ruowan

187
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:24,240
must die.

188
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,320
What?

189
00:09:25,520 --> 00:09:26,440
Don't worry.

190
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,260
After Xue Ruowan dies,

191
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,700
the story timeline will restart.

192
00:09:30,760 --> 00:09:32,040
All past events

193
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,280
will be wiped clean.

194
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:34,600
All characters

195
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:36,160
will come back to life.

196
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:38,160
There's only one chance left.

197
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:40,490
Trying again doesn't guarantee success.

198
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:42,120
You're only one step away

199
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:43,680
from the finale now.

200
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,840
Think carefully before making a decision.

201
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,800
Why force me

202
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,800
to make such a decision?

203
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,000
Ying'er!

204
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:58,200
Is what he said true?

205
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,320
Will everyone really come back to life

206
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:04,000
if I die?

207
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,600
If so,

208
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,370
I'm willing to do it.

209
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:27,360
You always say

210
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:29,300
I'm the heroine of some story,

211
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,480
and that our lives

212
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:32,580
are tied together.

213
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,050
You've always saved me before.

214
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:36,800
This time,

215
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:39,840
let me do it.

216
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,240
No!

217
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,540
Besides, I believe

218
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,560
you'll keep me safe,

219
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:54,760
won't you?

220
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:01,440
Silly girl.

221
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:04,640
Be brave.

222
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:17,800
Sister!

223
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:20,080
Sister!

224
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:26,720
No!

225
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:41,560
These are

226
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:44,760
a maid's clothes.

227
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:49,120
I've become Lan again.

228
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:54,960
This is Jinming Pool.

229
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,320
The timeline has returned

230
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:59,520
to the night of the engagement banquet.

231
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:01,660
She dances so well.

232
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:08,980
Wonderful.

233
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:12,700
It's still Xue Keying's face.

234
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:18,520
So wonderful.

235
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:20,440
Young Master Chu is so handsome.

236
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,680
Chu Qingyun!

237
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,170
Chu Qingyun!

238
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:25,850
Miss, you are...

239
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:26,720
It is me,

240
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:27,420
Xue Keying,

241
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:28,800
the Second Miss
of the Duke of Ying's Mansion,

242
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:30,460
Xue Ruowan's younger sister.

243
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:31,740
As far as I know,

244
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,320
the Duke of Ying has only one daughter

245
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,320
named Xue Ruowan.

246
00:12:34,680 --> 00:12:35,810
I have never heard of

247
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:36,680
her having a younger sister.
